@startuml rbac-account-status
title Status Akun (existing) + Posisi Role Admin (add-admin-rbac)
' Sumber: auth-service-client/src/lib.rs (AccountStatus) + add-admin-rbac.
' State machine status akun SUDAH ADA di kode; role adalah dimensi ORTHOGONAL yang ditambahkan.

[*] --> pending_verification

pending_verification --> profile_incomplete : email terverifikasi (OTP)
profile_incomplete --> pending_kyc : kirim data KYC lengkap
pending_kyc --> active : admin approve
pending_kyc --> rejected : admin reject
rejected --> pending_kyc : ajukan ulang (cooldown 3 hari kerja)
active --> suspended_temp : suspend sementara (+ alasan + bukti)
active --> suspended_permanent : suspend permanen (+ alasan + bukti; hapus dok)
suspended_temp --> active : expires_at terlewati
suspended_permanent --> [*] : terminal

note right of active
  Hanya status `active` yang boleh memakai fitur
  (can_use_features()). Ditegakkan require_active_account.
end note

legend bottom
  Dimensi ORTHOGONAL: role (add-admin-rbac)
  ----
  role = 'user'  : pengguna umum (jalani state machine di atas)
  role = 'admin' : di-inject DBA, diasumsikan langsung `active`,
                   TIDAK menjalani KYC. CHECK extensible →
                   kelak super_admin / moderator / support.
  JwtClaims/AuthClaims menambah field `role` (aditif).
endlegend
@enduml
